{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_skgoat_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_skgoat_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "額外的工作",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_skgoat_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f89d2978ef4a37ce7ef144b86f1ec0e96c50c4e7565f1f7058d0f4d6404994e5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "个人剧情 地灵"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "這個地方節奏有點亂了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "琴鍵很重，後面速度一快是不是就有點跟不上？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "有一點，不過我能克服的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "多練習就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "今天練得夠多了，你的姿勢已經開始變形。以這種變形的姿勢繼續練習下去，反而會起到不好的效果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "歇一歇吧， 你的進步已經很大了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "但下一課又不知道得什麼時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "如果我有一天也能像地靈前輩一樣會彈琴就好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "你很有天賦，一定會有那天的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "嗨！地靈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "博士讓我來找......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "嗯？怎麼艾雅法拉也在這！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "我在教阿黛爾彈琴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "我以為這算是你的保留技能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "沒必要保留。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "就算是那個音樂院校雲集的萊塔尼亞，也不會強迫每個人都學音樂吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "再說，我們是在羅德島上呀，不會樂器也沒什麼關係吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "羅德島其實也沒什麼適合萊塔尼亞人的娛樂設施。業餘時間學點樂器既是休閒，又能讓人在這樣的日子裡感受到片刻的安寧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "而且在萊塔尼亞，一個擁有較高音樂素養的人，會被認為擁有更高水準的教育。這是在聚集區內的感染者難以擁有的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "（學會音樂這一技之長，日後去萊塔尼亞，隱瞞感染者身份也比較方便。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "（地靈前輩在說什麼我已經完全聽不清楚啦！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "好癢！知道了！知道了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "教阿黛爾也是為了提前做個試驗，方便以後教其他人的時候安排課程時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "不過艾雅法拉學得還挺快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "我上次回來大概是多久前？也沒多久吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "現在就已經能彈得像模像樣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "現在才是第三次課，已經能斷斷續續彈這首高盧語命名的《月光曲》了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "我也沒想到，阿黛爾在音樂方面也那麼有天賦，真讓人羡慕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "美妙的音樂，能讓我們在如今的歲月裡，在殘餘的生命中，多少也感知到一點點美好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "我覺得音樂很有趣，以前我爸爸媽媽也會教我，但是是和這個不一樣的萊塔尼亞樂器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "可是這個琴鍵真的好沉重，速度一快就跟不上了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "真好聽啊。這個樂器與傳統琴的音色差別真大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "每次聽都讓我感覺很震撼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "普羅旺斯姐姐！聽我說，這個樂器原本可大了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "我以前沒彈過，但我在我媽媽教書的學校裡見過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "大概有大禮堂的一整面牆那麼大！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "現在的這個是用傳統的琴改造而來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "要盡可能地還原音色，還要縮小尺寸，其實做出了很多妥協。琴鍵如此沉重，就是妥協的結果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "如果你能聽到真傢伙的聲音，那肯定還要震撼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "這麼說你是要帶我去你老家旅遊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "好期待！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "我老家不過是萊塔尼亞某個窮鄉僻壤裡的村子而已，可沒這個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "對了！差點把正事給忘了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "博士拜託我找你來著，要我把這份東西給你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "哦？麻煩的事情又要來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "你手裡的是......又是要填的地質分析報告？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "讓我看看。嗯......需要羅德島前方航線的可通過性地質報告......還需要近期附近天災發生可能性報告......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "以及五份地質樣本的分析，需要對其所屬年代以及礦物質構成進行鑑別......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "博士有說這些大概是什麼時候要嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "後天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "後天就要？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "這些工作即使讓一個三人的專業小組來處理都需要至少兩天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "羅德島並沒有這麼多的地質學專業人員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "而且，作為醫療企業，羅德島現在沒有，今後也沒有成立地質實驗室的計畫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "總結，我們缺少人力且缺少設備，且將會長期處於這種狀態。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "地靈前輩！要不要我也來幫忙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "也不用那麼擔心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "有我在，沒問題的。阿黛爾，你還是多放鬆放鬆，休息休息，交給我吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "地靈前輩，今天我已經休、休息了很久了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "後天你還要和巴蒂一起外出工作不是嗎？好好休息，我的工作我也能處理好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "不過這次我沒法陪你一起去了，你的助聽器工作狀態如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "在羅德島的室內環境下暫時沒什麼問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "室外的話，希望也不會有什麼問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "那就好，如果外出需要一些設備支援，你可以去找你的另一個前輩說說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "那傢伙雖然是個工作狂，但也一直很關心你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "嗯......但{@nickname}前輩一直很忙。我、我怕打擾到前輩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "沒關係，我會在出發前把要準備的都準備妥當的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "嗯。我今天也打算先舒舒服服睡一覺，準備好充足的精神，明天起來再開工。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "不是人手不夠嗎，這樣也來得及？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "充足的休息，以及適當的娛樂，才能保障在上班的時候能夠百分之百投入注意力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "尤其這類研究的工作，原本專注半小時能解決的問題，在身心俱疲的情況下可能通宵好幾天都毫無進展。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "當然這份工作還是得加班一下，至於加班費......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "博士剛才拍著胸脯說加班費會按標準給的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "那最好。反正只要沒有額外的工作，我就來得及。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "那正好，我這裡也需要一份報告！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "嘿嘿，麻煩你啦！反正都已經要加班了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "這次又是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "老樣子啦，老樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "還是天災信使工作參考用的地質分析報告。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "樣本呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "已經放在你的樣本儲存盒裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "那麼你又是什麼時候要？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "越快越好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "說得挺輕巧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "你作為一個天災信使，鮮有在羅德島本艦待著的時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "每次回來，就塞給我一堆工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "你是不是忘了除同事的關係外，我們也是朋友？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "沒辦法，天災信使的工作就是這樣嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "我現在也只是回來一趟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "很快要走嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "是啊，工作還沒結束。我就回來要份報告，要到就得走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "需求。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "儘量讓看這份報告的傢伙一頭霧水，以至於放棄理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "專業點是吧，沒問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "什麼是一頭霧水的報告啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "這是一種天災信使專用的報告啦，不過大多數時間並不是給我們這些天災信使看的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "大多數時間，是給雇主或是當地管事的人看的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "由天災信使邀請學者提供各類資料分析，讓對方根據資料自行判斷是否需要遷移躲避天災，也是一種工作方式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "這樣，誤報的風險就轉移到了做判斷的對方身上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "在這種情況下，如果天災沒有發生，因為城鎮遷移而造成的經濟損失，就無法怪罪到天災信使頭上來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "畢竟天災信使也只是普通人，有正常人該有的所有心情，也會犯錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "有的天災信使因為一次誤報進而失去信心，自我懷疑，最後不再從事這份工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "出錯是很正常的。可是天災信使這份工作，犯一次錯要承擔的後果太嚴重了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "這種轉移風險的模式，也是為了保護天災信使而誕生的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "不過，這樣就增加了資料分析方面的工作量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "而且來來回回跑也需要時間，我只能幫到離羅德島較近的天災信使。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "這樣也挺好，你就能有更多時間留在羅德島上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "如果你還像從前一樣作為天災信使與地質學專家到處亂跑，我們可能一年都見不到幾次面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "這就是你揮霍見面機會的理由嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "哎呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "別嬉皮笑臉的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "當初建議我這樣做的，可是你啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "沒錯，我不希望任何人重蹈巴赫曼老師的悲劇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "啊！是那位古爾克私立學院的巴赫曼教授嗎？那可是萊塔尼亞有名的地質學家與音樂家，原來她是地靈前輩的老師啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "我的媽媽認識她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "小時候，我過生日時她還正好來過我家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "當然，她並不知道那天是我的生日，只是因為工作上的事情來找我的媽媽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "知道是我生日後，就為我演奏了一曲作為禮物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "我記得她也能彈出非常美妙的音樂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "那也是我最崇拜的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "巴赫曼教授發生什麼事了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "一個地方貴族指名雇傭她作為天災信使，她也給出了專業的分析。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "巴赫曼教授居然也是天災信使？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "雖然不像她的地質學家與音樂家身份那麼有名，但她確實是一位天災信使。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "貴族要求巴赫曼老師給出一個最終的，明確的答案——天災究竟會不會發生......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "......居民究竟要不要轉移。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "巴赫曼老師其實是位很純粹的萊塔尼亞學者，雖然很年長，卻沒有什麼城府。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "她所考慮的，都是最保守的方式。因此，對當地地質環境進行分析後，她建議居民還是立刻轉移為好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "結果，天災並沒有發生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "當地居民回到原來的地方，他們的作物爛在了地裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "僅剩的那些糧食，必須上交給貴族。於是，他們難免要忍饑挨餓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "在收繳糧食時，面對蜷縮著的哭乞的居民們，貴族的喉舌們如是說......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "“都是那個巴赫曼的錯，如果她沒有誤報，我們就不需要轉移避險。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "“都是因為她，才害你們這樣。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "“都是她的錯。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "民眾的怒火被點燃了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "他們趁夜襲擊了巴赫曼老師，拿石頭把她砸暈，綁起來，要把她燒死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "連那位巴赫曼教授都......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "所以你不希望任何人再遇到這樣的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "你想透過學識，而非武力，來保護他人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "前輩喜歡地質學是因為這個原因，用學識來保護人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "不，不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "我起初學地質學的目的很簡單。和你不同，我並沒有足夠的法術天賦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "感染礦石病後我現有的源石技藝變強了，但這不代表我的天賦也變強了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "在源石技藝方面，我太笨拙了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "你可真是太謙虛了，這都算笨拙的話我一定傻到離譜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "後半句倒不假。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "以我的天賦，固執地學習源石技藝是沒有用的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "小時候我很聰明，父母給了我很大期望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "我從小讀很多書，超前地掌握了各種基礎源石技藝及其理論技巧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "周圍的人都認為我以後必將有所出息。我的父母期望我能改變我們家族的地位，讓我們能搬進城裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "但隨著我慢慢長大，要學的東西越來越複雜，我發現光“聰明”是沒有用的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "就算理論了然於胸，沒有天賦就是沒有天賦，做不到就是做不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "地質學不一樣。對我而言，只要努力學習，我能在這裡找到自己......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "找到父母原本期望的那個我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "所以其實一開始你是不得不學習地質學？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "不是“不得不”，而是巴赫曼老師的地質學課程，在我最失落絕望的時刻拯救了我，接納了我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "從那時起，我才開始學習地質學，通過一個個小小的成就，逐漸愛上它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "這是一個有我容身之處的地方，一個家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "可是地質學聽起來還是挺枯燥的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "正相反，就算這片大地上的所有書疊起來，都是有窮盡的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "地質學，是一個無窮無盡的書架。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "每一次實地考察，都能從勘探中找到不同的故事，瞭解每個地方的歷史演變。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "就好像它們在對我低語......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "地質學就是一座無窮盡的自然的圖書館。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "從這方面來說，既不無聊，也不會寂寞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "這麼說你在這裡上班還挺開心的囉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "不是的，普羅旺斯姐姐。只在室內進行檢測與研究，不是地質學。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "分析其他天災信使帶來的土壤泥巴中的成分情況，並分析天災可能性，也不是地質學。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "地靈前輩現在所用的設備是可攜式的，功能十分簡陋，是外出勘探採樣時使用的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "我和我的設備最近一直待在室內，只是因為天災信使們需要我，羅德島需要我而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "不過最近的工作也有點太多了吧？為什麼連一些不熟的天災信使都跑來找我要報告了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "作為天災信使，預測錯了以後，心裡還是會很不好受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "你的報告也可以讓我們對結果有一個大致的預估。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "一般這種報告都是找學者寫的，專業程度先不提，經常會出現報告內容並不是工作所需的情況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "而你除了是優秀的地質學家，本身也是一位非常厲害的天災信使。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "所以哪怕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "哪怕不需要給雇主看，也會想要一份來作參考。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "噢？怪不得我的工作量變大了，原來還有這一部分原因啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "嘿嘿嘿嘿！多虧了我！你的名氣已經在天災信使當中傳開了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "“那位範克圖爾的大師”，他們都這麼叫你。是不是超級有格調？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "那也就是說，前面幾次你叫我做的事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "那些莫名其妙的加班......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普羅旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "啊對了，我得去洗澡了，文件就先放這裡啦——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "你給我站住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "糟糕，我腿麻了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_180_amgoat",
      "operatorId": "char_180_amgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_180_amgoat",
      "text": "前輩，要不要我幫你去追！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "不用，我走幾步就不麻了！你休息一下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "腳......啊......好麻......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地靈",
      "speakerToken": "char_183_skgoat_1",
      "operatorId": "char_183_skgoat",
      "portraitKey": "char_183_skgoat",
      "text": "普羅旺斯！你給我站住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
